NOTE ON SCOPE
-------------

This license covers only the files written for this port that are not derived
from earlier BuildCraft code. Those files carry a header naming this file.

Files ported from BuildCraft 8.0.x keep the license they already had, because
neither of those licenses permits relicensing someone else's code:

  * buildcraft.api.* is MIT, under "LICENSE.API". Ported API files keep the
    original BuildCraft copyright notice, as MIT requires, with the port's
    copyright added alongside it.

  * Everything else -- the 1.12.2 tree in common/ and sub_projects/expression/
    -- is Mozilla Public License 2.0, under "LICENSE-NEW". MPL 2.0 section 3.1
    does not allow the license on a covered file to be changed, so ported files
    stay MPL 2.0 with the port's copyright added.

Relicensing those would need agreement from every contributor to the files
concerned; license_checker/ in this repository is the tooling the BuildCraft
team used for exactly that when they moved from MMPL to MPL 2.0.
